   "kind": "title",
   "html": "Pacific Paradise",
   "plain": "Pacific Paradise"
  },
  {
   "kind": "description",
   "html": "I led art and production direction across identity, mapping, and environmental graphics, specifying high‑contrast typography and simple iconography, issuing material specs and finish schedules with ADA‑aware decisions, and conducting field testing and install reviews; families made quicker decisions thanks to intuitive wayfinding, the park gained a cohesive story with photo‑worthy moments, and installs landed on time with minimal rework.",
   "plain": "I led art and production direction across identity, mapping, and environmental graphics, specifying high‑contrast typography and simple iconography, issuing material specs and finish schedules with ADA‑aware decisions, and conducting field testing and install reviews; families made quicker decisions thanks to intuitive wayfinding, the park gained a cohesive story with photo‑worthy moments, and installs landed on time with minimal rework."
  },
